</div>
<div id="alg1.4.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.2.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="alg1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> </span>Mapping of original identifiers to new identifiers, modified code
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.3" class="ltx_listingline">
